# LcView 结构化事件日志子系统 Kconfig 配置
#
# 启用后编译 LcView 内核模块，提供：
#   1. Builder API（供内核其他模块调用，记录结构化事件）
#   2. 环形缓冲区（无锁写 + overflow eviction）
#   3. /dev/vendor_lechao_lcview 字符设备（供用户态读取）
#
# 依赖：CONFIG_VENDOR_LECHAO（父菜单选项）

config LCVIEW
    bool "LcView logging trace subsystem"
    help
      LcView is a structured event logging system for kernel modules.
      It provides a builder-style API for other kernel code to log
      events, stores them in a ring buffer, and exposes the data via
      /dev/vendor_lechao_lcview character device.

      If unsure, say N.
